   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Wash produce with drinking-quality water.</li><li>Cut tomatoes into <b><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"mm\" data-a=\"5\" data-s=\"0\">5 mm</span></b> dice with a sharp knife.</li><li>Keep the juicy flesh; if very watery, leave only the excess puddle behind.</li><li>Finely dice optional cucumber and pepper to the same size.</li></ul>",
